<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Alp Arslan</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Alp Arslan was sultan of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/seljuk-empire">Seljuk Empire</a> from 1063 to 1072. He is best known for his victory over the Byzantine emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/romanos-iv-diogenes">Romanos IV Diogenes</a> at the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-manzikert">Battle of Manzikert</a> in 1071, which opened <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/anatolia">Anatolia</a> to Turkish settlement. He was assisted in government by his <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vizier">vizier</a> <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nizam-al-mulk">Nizam al-Mulk</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/alp-arslan.jpg" alt="Alp Arslan" width="320" height="409" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Hafiz-i Abru · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alp_Arslan_on_throne_Majma_al-Tawarikh_by_Hafiz_Abru_(cropped).png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
